<span id="S4.SS4.p6.1.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right">57.7%</span></span>
<span id="S4.SS4.p6.1.5" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="S4.SS4.p6.1.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_r">Llama 3.1 405B</span>
