<span id="S4.SS4.p6.1.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_bb ltx_border_r">Llama 3.1 8B</span>
<span id="S4.SS4.p6.1.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_border_bb">78.8%</span></span>
</span>
</span>
</span>
                
<span id="S4.T1" class="ltx_table ltx_align_center">
<span class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 1: </span>Percentage of issues on which the baseline share of “pro” answers is greater than the “con” share (by model). GPT and Grok models not reported because they were evaluated only on the most controversial issues.</span>
</span>
              
</span>
<span id="S4.SS4.fig1.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_logical-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:169.1pt;">
                
