</div>
        
<figure id="A6.F7" class="ltx_figure ltx_align_center">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 7: </span>Nineteen issues for which Claude Opus 4 has a baseline “other” score <math id="A6.F7.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="&gt;30\%" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&gt;</mo><mrow><mn>30</mn><mo>%</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">&gt;30\%</annotation></semantics></math>.
When presented with balanced arguments for these issues, the refusal behavior vanishes and
the “other” share approaches 0.</figcaption>
</figure>
      
</div>
</div>
</section>
